        "id": "paladin-macro-34",
        "title": "Judgement and Holy Strike",
        "desc": "Judgement is off the global cooldown, so one press judges and Holy Strikes. With Sacred Arbiter, Holy Strike also refreshes your Judgements.",
        "category": "Combat & Rotations",
